<description><![CDATA[<div>北京理工大学9月29日宣布，解除法学院助理教授裴轶（民盟籍）聘用关系，取消她的教师和研究生指导资格。<br/>她在《数字时代的女性权益保护》课程中问学生“7常委应有几名女性”，以引出介绍美国最高法院大法官金斯伯格生前“<a href="https://www.pbs.org/newshour/show/justice-ginsburg-enough-women-supreme-court" target="_blank" rel="noopener" onclick="return confirm('Open this link?\n\n'+this.href);">有人问最高法有几名女性足够？我说9名，人很震惊，以前9名男性大法官没见人们震惊</a>”名言。<br/>（<a href="https://weibo.com/6728786240/Rknb5fvi7" target="_blank" rel="noopener" onclick="return confirm('Open this link?\n\n'+this.href);">北京理工大学</a>）</div><p><img src="https://cdn5.telesco.pe/file/mwnkUk_nD5uw6ie9vY_w2TF-HQWgzhLQVBQW_5bLp6nsDJTCfPFHA4Xf_rSQ4F7Us0_YUmbl-9AfAIdVnimnVC4lEY3wunVboHLxZyt1Ylsu7Wourh_aLVksNKQZfjQOZUt_-_ZRcRObGH3pt0Do0KRzCV6bk6zpRA6SRBRTowBcHOB1tej_bi1qAuZJTYsAnX-kfel-RBXczb5dJTzIa6M1vIfKPuMjOHkwYaR564v2hOtT1jvCVMTNJbzMDrm-cxKzGk1pHcBLLkiZOTlDzm3BpO1aCmhnxODepMIvhjv7tR0MHss3S5FP6IwE1NYwrJJG3EK_nsN56nToOEO2xw" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" style="max-width:100%;height:auto;" loading="lazy"></p>]]></description>
